README.release
--------------

1. Get latest aspell-lang from:

   git clone https://https.git.savannah.gnu.org/git/aspell/aspell-lang.git

2. Create wordlist without -, ., :, () etc

3. sort wordlist.txt wordlist-final.txt

4. cp wordlist.txt gu.wl

5. prezip -z -s gu.wl

6. ./proc create

7. ./configure
